BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Assassins the Musical
DTSTART:20261108T140000
DTEND:20261108T160000
DTSTAMP:20261113T183559Z
UID:2a2c3f87f556ac3c9b6fba66161656@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:Assassins is Stephen Sondheim’s daring\, darkly comic musica
 l that brings together the men and women who attempted—or succeeded—in
  assassinating U.S. presidents. Provocative\, unsettling\, and often distu
 rbingly funny\, the musical challenges audiences to confront the myths of 
 success\, entitlement\, and patriotism at the heart of American culture. T
 his production continues Wild Goose Players’ commitment to live theatre 
 that challenges\, engages\, and invites conversation. 🎭 Content Warning
 : this show has an R-rating and deals with many sensitive topics including
  gun violence\, suicide\, executions\, drug use\, cults/brainwashing and p
 rofanity including a racial slur. Next Stage Arts Every week through Nov 1
 4\, 2026.\n\nSources: Vermont Public
LOCATION:Vermont Public is independent\, community-supported media\, servi
 ng Vermont with trusted\, relevant and essential information. We share sto
 ries that bring people together\, from every corner of our region.\, © 20
 26 Vermont Public | 365 Troy Ave. Colchester\, VT 05446
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/assassins-
 the-musical-19-10-2026-15-37-31
END:VEVENT
